      "productType": "Matching Family Pajamas",
      "status": "DRAFT",
      "publishedAt": null,
      "onlineStoreUrl": null,
      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft brushed velvet knit made of 100% polyester.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> One cozy pajama look for mom and her little girl, made for slow weekend mornings, bedtime stories, and matching photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> Blue and cream gingham with a rounded Peter Pan collar, red piping, and red buttons; the pants are the same gingham with red-piped hems.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Long-sleeve button-front top with a rounded Peter Pan collar, plus full-length pants with an elastic waist.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Follow the care label sewn into each garment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 5-6 Years through Child 10-11 Years, and Mother S through Mother XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Pajama Set</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\" class=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n<th>Sleeve (cm)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short (cm)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5-6 Years</td>\n<td>5-6</td>\n<td>19–22.5 kg</td>\n<td>110–120 cm</td>\n<td>76 cm</td>\n<td>32 cm</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n<td>80 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>47 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 7 Years</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>22.5–27.5 kg</td>\n<td>120–130 cm</td>\n<td>80 cm</td>\n<td>36 cm</td>\n<td>72 cm</td>\n<td>84 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>50 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8-9 Years</td>\n<td>8-9</td>\n<td>25–30 kg</td>\n<td>125–135 cm</td>\n<td>84 cm</td>\n<td>40 cm</td>\n<td>78 cm</td>\n<td>88 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>53 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 10-11 Years</td>\n<td>10-11</td>\n<td>27.5–34 kg</td>\n<td>135–145 cm</td>\n<td>88 cm</td>\n<td>44 cm</td>\n<td>84 cm</td>\n<td>92 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>57 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>34–42.5 kg</td>\n<td>145–155 cm</td>\n<td>92 cm</td>\n<td>47 cm</td>\n<td>90 cm</td>\n<td>96 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>60 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>42.5–50 kg</td>\n<td>150–160 cm</td>\n<td>98 cm</td>\n<td>50 cm</td>\n<td>93 cm</td>\n<td>100 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>50–57.5 kg</td>\n<td>160–165 cm</td>\n<td>102 cm</td>\n<td>52 cm</td>\n<td>96 cm</td>\n<td>104 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>65 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>57.5–67.5 kg</td>\n<td>165–170 cm</td>\n<td>106 cm</td>\n<td>54 cm</td>\n<td>99 cm</td>\n<td>108 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>68 cm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Mom and daughter can wear the same pajama set, with child and women's sizes. Pick a size for each of you separately to build your matching look.</p>\n\n<p>Each size is one two-piece set with a top and pants. Garment length is the top length; pant length is the full pants length. The waist is elastic. Height and weight are a general fit guide, and child ages are typical for those heights. Measurements are approximate, so compare chest and lengths with pajamas that fit well today.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom-and-daughter match:</strong> The same pajama set in child sizes plus a women's cut.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Peter Pan collar:</strong> A rounded collar trimmed in red piping on the blue gingham top.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft knit:</strong> A soft brushed velvet knit that keeps the chill off on winter nights.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready:</strong> Coordinated colors made for mommy-and-me photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Full size range:</strong> Four child sizes and four women's sizes; see the size chart for measurements.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need for cozy matching nights at home.</p>",
